       01 WE   PIC NBNN/N0N USAGE NATIONAL.
       01 WG   PIC GBG.
       01 WD   PIC NN/N USAGE DISPLAY-1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE NC'東京大阪名' TO WE
           DISPLAY '<' WE '> ' FUNCTION LENGTH (WE) ' '
                   FUNCTION HEX-OF (WE)
           MOVE G'漢字' TO WG
           DISPLAY '<' WG '> ' FUNCTION HEX-OF (WG)
           MOVE G'日本語' TO WD
           DISPLAY '<' WD '> ' FUNCTION HEX-OF (WD)
